Evacuation and Assembly If the entity fails to record its evacuation and gathering procedures in another plan, they should be recorded here. The procedures should mention the steps to be taken to evacuate staff, visitors, and people with special needs from the building. It should also identify the procedure of calculating the number of employees who were in the building. Gathering areas should be identified in illustrative pictures, to indicate the place where building occupants should be heading after evacuating the building. The evacuation section of a plan should:
